                                        "entry_id": "4ad1fdc6-b074-3611-8ece-1a81b6c8ed07",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pertaining to the last geologic period of the Paleozoic era; comprising the Cisuralian, Guadalupian and Lopingian epochs from about 280 to 248 million years ago."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a3d6ca37-759e-437f-866a-e2b8085b9468",
                                                "sense_id": "7b7daa54-3fea-3588-b8e9-aa2c7940de12",
                                                "text": "‘In many ways modern art was a culture of the beach. They say it's the light, the special quality of quartz in the Permian rock.’"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
